    {
      "name": "资料手机",
      "texts": [
        {
          "selector": "a.skip-link",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "跳到主要内容"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.brand__name",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "山中有路"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.brand__place",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "西迁文化园"
        },
        {
          "selector": "h2.",
          "size": 32,
          "text": "资料与说明"
        },
        {
          "selector": "a.ghost-btn",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "返回地图"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "这张地图以浙江大学紫金港校区北山西迁文化园的纪念景观，连接 1937—1946 年的西迁故事。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "h3.",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "地图依据"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "路网依 2026 年 11 月补充的三张清晰地图重绘；景观点位由此前的现场标注配准转绘。碑亭与求是巢在新图中有明确标识，其余景观仍需实地复核。石刻中的樟树、衡阳、宜山、湄潭依现场标注放在交叉口，其余点位沿园路均匀示意分布，不代表精确实测位置。本图为导览示意，不是测绘成果。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "画风参考"
        },
        {
          "selector": "a.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "浙江大学常用生活地图"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "。地图几何参考图含 OpenStreetMap 数据，©"
        },
        {
          "selector": "a.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "OpenStreetMap 贡献者"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "石刻介绍以西迁记载为主；未能核实的事件和日期标为待考。出处见详情中的“资料来源”。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "h3.",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "图像与历史"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "照片为园区实拍，插画为历史示意图。出处见各景点的“资料来源”。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "summary.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "查看故事与雕塑对应"
        },
        {
          "selector": "b.",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "抢运校产"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "抢运校产（P02-1）"
        },
        {
          "selector": "b.",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "保护四库全书"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "保护四库全书（P02-3）"
        },
        {
          "selector": "b.",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "费巩明灯"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "费巩明灯（P02-2）、桐油灯（P02-6）"
        },
        {
          "selector": "b.",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "手摇发电亮灯"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "手摇发电亮灯（P02-5）"
        },
        {
          "selector": "b.",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "百鸟归林"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "百鸟归林（P02-4）"
        },
        {
          "selector": "summary.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "西迁时间轴"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "1937 年离开杭州，1946 年复员归来。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1937.11.05"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "日军在金山卫登陆，距杭州一百二十公里。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1937.11.11"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "浙大师生一千多人分三批自杭州江干码头乘乌篷船，沿钱塘江、富春江迁往建德，随行图书仪器七百多箱、二百余吨。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1937.12.01"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "《浙大日报》在建德创刊；学校设情报委员会收录广播消息，工读学生上街头叫卖。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1937.12.26"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "部分师生与七百多箱图书仪器过金华时遇空袭，三十多艘民船船主弃船逃走，师生在风天雪地里拦截兵车、货车、煤车逐箱抢运。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S5]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1938.01.06"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "抢运的图书仪器全部到达江西玉山。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S5]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1938.07"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "泰和霍乱、痢疾流行，竺可桢次子竺衡与夫人张侠魂先后不治；8 月 10 日全校公祭。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1938.11.01"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "竺可桢在广西宜山开学典礼上发表《王阳明与大学生的典范》演讲。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1938.11.19"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "校务会议正式确定「求是」为校训。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1939.02.05"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "日军十八架飞机轰炸宜山标营，投燃烧弹与爆裂弹共一百一十八枚，炸毁宿舍、礼堂与教室；全校无一伤亡。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1940"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "学校迁至贵州遵义、湄潭；训导长费巩自费订做八百多盏「费巩灯」发给学生。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S7]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1940 年代"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "王国松在遵义何家巷用柴油机带发电机，每晚发电三小时供学生自修。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S10]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1943"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "李政道考入浙江大学，在湄潭永兴茶楼读书。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "1946"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "抗战胜利，浙大复员返回杭州。西迁历时九年，落脚建德、吉安、泰和、宜山、遵义、湄潭。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S11]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "h3.",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "北山与校友林沿革"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2002"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "紫金港校区北山建成，为校园内海拔最高的人工山地，占地 6 万平方米。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S34]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2004.03.12"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "「春之约」植树活动启动，150 余位同学与校领导在校友林植下首批 20 棵香樟。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S2]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2005.03.17"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "「遵义林」「湄潭林」在北山西侧揭牌，由 4 个学生支部负责养护。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S15]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2013.05.21"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "西迁办学纪念碑亭在北山南坡落成揭幕（建校 116 周年）。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S3]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2015"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "学校将整座北山开辟为「西迁文化园」，年底着手布局西迁线路、设置二维码铜牌。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S12]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2016"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "学校选取西迁途中的故事设计创作六座主题雕塑。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S5]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2017.05.20"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "西迁文化园迎来首批客人，园中已有六座完成的雕塑作品。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S5]"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__date",
          "size": 20,
          "text": "2024.01"
        },
        {
          "selector": "p.tl__text",
          "size": 14,
          "text": "建筑学专业 10 名同学用一个周末搭起「求是巢」木构。"
        },
        {
          "selector": "span.tl__src",
          "size": 12,
          "text": "[S24]"
        },
